{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39883","headline":"经故广平员外旧宅 · 徐夤","name":"经故广平员外旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门巷萧条引涕洟，遗孤三岁着麻衣。\n绿杨树老垂丝短，翠竹林荒着笋稀。\n结社僧因秋朔吊，买书船近葬时归。\n平生欲献匡君策，抱病犹言未息机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}